1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
This song is for the survivors everybody thinks are fine

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,460
'Cause the treatment's in the rearview, and they're smiling all the time

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:10,660
But the fight left something with us that a scan will never show

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:14,020
So go easy on your people, there's a lot you'll never know

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,060
We all need the reminder, I need it as much as you

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:20,580
Don't build a prison for tomorrow out of what might not come true

7
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:23,860
Take today for what it gives you, let the what-ifs drift away

8
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,900
'Cause the echo can keep ringing, but it doesn't own my day

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:30,340
They say the scans are looking clean, but my body won't believe it

10
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:39,460
'Cause the last time they said nothing's wrong, it was there, and I could feel it

11
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:44,820
The battle's over, but the alarm's still on

12
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:51,780
Four years clear, and it's ringing just as strong

13
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,440
You see me smiling, and you figure I'm alright
